# Build
/target/
**/target/
# Cargo.lock is committed for reproducible Docker/CI builds.
# Editor / IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local human-verified upstream checkouts (GRUB / linux / CCID / gnulib).
# Never commit these trees — multi-GiB sources stay on disk only; see docs/VENDORING.md.
/vendor/

# Test fixtures (large images)
testdata/*.img
testdata/*.bin
testdata/vendor-blobs/
testdata/blob-build/
testdata/det-blobs/
!testdata/.gitkeep

# Fuzz corpora artifacts
**/fuzz/artifacts/
**/fuzz/corpus/

# Coverage / profiling
*.profraw
*.profdata
lcov.info
coverage/

# Secrets / local env (never commit)
.env
*.pem
*.key
